Investigate an unresolved mining or mineral-processing question with independent evidence (@mine-research: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../sources/Operations-Research-in-Mine-Planning.lingua#r_3WX1KW34EWEGYZ6HGEMGGQBKHS", #source "../sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP", #source "../sources/McPherson-Subsurface-Ventilation.lingua#r_3KH110VQV6VEA56FVWV8D7W6AY", #source "../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA", #source "../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "Completion-and-continuing-mining-studies.lingua#r_0GAPV1K4KYPK29BCE7GF7QVFQ9") { r_6W8ZNWYXBYCFRMSPEVT5AVSWV8
**Read:** [A Review of Operations Research in Mine Planning — Newman and colleagues](../sources/Operations-Research-in-Mine-Planning.lingua#r_3WX1KW34EWEGYZ6HGEMGGQBKHS), the whole review and complete original methods selected for the question; [Practical Rock Engineering — Evert Hoek](../sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP), the full relevant theory/calibration papers for ground research; [Subsurface Ventilation Engineering — Malcolm J. McPherson](../sources/McPherson-Subsurface-Ventilation.lingua#r_3KH110VQV6VEA56FVWV8D7W6AY), the complete relevant theory and primary methods for network/environment research; [Tratamento de Minérios — CETEM, sixth edition](../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA), the full relevant theory and original methods for processing research; [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ), reuse reproducibility, independent validation, numerical/stochastic methods, and preservation.

Choose a consequential question that existing reading has not settled: geological/processing uncertainty in adaptive scheduling, scale-dependent ground response, network/environment identification, coupled separation/water chemistry, representative accounting, or long-term waste/closure behavior are possible directions. Define a precise question and a gap supported by complete primary papers, not a list of fashionable terms.

Read the full foundational method, later developments, independent replication/comparison, and critical or contradictory evidence. Reconstruct the original assumptions, observations, model/code, uncertainty, and limits. Distinguish physical identifiability from numerical fit and actual new information from a more elaborate parameterization.

Reproduce a substantial published result with independently checkable calculations. Design an experiment, field comparison, benchmark, analytic development, or rigorously scoped supplied-data study that could reject the preferred explanation. Test competing models, changed conditions, limiting cases, correlated measurement/selection errors, and transfer beyond calibration.

**Work:** produce an original research-style argument with complete methods, authorized external source references, inspectable original calculations, uncertainty, alternatives, failed predictions, and independently supported conclusions. Explain what genuinely changes the engineering/scientific understanding and what remains unknown or inaccessible. Another reader must be able to challenge and reproduce the central claim from the stated evidence. Practical research reports the actual facilities, supervision, methods, and observations rather than implying that scholarship alone certifies operating competence.

**Continue:** [Explain, calculate, investigate, and defend a complete mining and processing system](Completion-and-continuing-mining-studies.lingua#r_0GAPV1K4KYPK29BCE7GF7QVFQ9).

**Return:** [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA).
